	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "5-way navigation cluster, five 12x12 mm tact switches on a 13.25 mm cross pitch. 26.5 mm centre-to-centre, 38.5 mm overall, D36 body, D37 panel cut-out, 11 mm above PCB. 20x D1.2 leg holes, 10x D1.7 boss holes. Two legs per switch edge are internally common, so each switch has two pad numbers used twice.")
